{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0073","paragraphs":[{"id":"p775cfd7219ce-1","text":"欲减罗衣寒未去。"},{"id":"p7596f9ff61c1-1","text":"不卷珠帘，人在深深处。"},{"id":"p45b0dbf1f5e3-1","text":"红杏枝头花几许。"},{"id":"p339a1d6469da-1","text":"啼痕止恨清明雨。"},{"id":"pd71dcab4f397-1","text":"尽日沈烟香一缕。"},{"id":"pe7be8b0748fc-1","text":"宿酒醒迟，恼破春情绪。"},{"id":"p71fe861caf11-1","text":"飞燕又将归信误。"},{"id":"p99ecbedca4fc-1","text":"小屏风上西江路。"}]}